flowchart TD
    Start([Plugin Loaded]) --> Scan[MissingAltTextScanner handles initial scan]
    Scan --> Summary[DashboardMetricsService stores summary counts]
    Summary --> AdminBootstrap[Admin SPA enqueued on dashboard/workbench routes]
    AdminBootstrap --> Localize[ContextAltTextAdmin payload includes workbench.items]
    Localize --> WorkbenchUI[Workbench App mounts]
    WorkbenchUI --> Filters{User filters queue?}
    Filters -- Yes --> Refetch[useWorkbenchMedia fetches /workbench/media]
    Filters -- No --> ShowQueue[Render initial items from payload]
    ShowQueue --> Select{User selects media?}
    Select -- Yes --> SelectionToolbar[SelectionToolbar captures selection state]
    SelectionToolbar --> BulkActions{Trigger bulk action?}
    BulkActions -- Generate Alt Text --> Dispatch[emitDashboardEvent + enqueue background job]
    BulkActions -- Review or other --> UpdateUI[Optimistic UI updates]
    Dispatch --> BackendJob[Backend service generates alt text]
    BackendJob --> QueueRefresh[Refetch queue to reflect new alt text status]
    QueueRefresh --> WorkbenchUI
